biological by the european union um yes certified

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:32.759
bio and are there any things that surprised you

00:10:32.759 --> 00:10:36.460
when you inherited the old release process Yeah,

00:10:36.539 --> 00:10:39.860
well, PEP 101 is something. You need to read

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.980
it. First of all, you need to Google and not

